# Advisory lock directory for dev-squad/state/queue.json (spec §5,
# squad-queue-worker). This is transient, per-machine, per-process state:
# if it were ever committed, cloning the repo would start with a
# permanently "held" lock, and the stale-lock recovery path keys off
# filesystem mtime, which git does not preserve across clones/checkouts.
state/queue.json.lock
